# Build output. The deck is regenerated by `python3 examples/course.py`; committing it would
# put a 400KB binary in every diff and let the file drift from the code that makes it.
examples/*.pptx
examples/render*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Stale build artifact tracked before the ignore below existed. showcase.py now writes to
# examples/, which is already ignored; this root copy was last built by a version of the file
# that no longer runs (it called cover(), which raises).
/showcase.pptx

# Written by the MIRROR in claude-infrastructure and symlinked back here by its deploy step.
# They describe the mirror, not this repo, and tracking them here made a loop: the mirror script
# read them from `git ls-files` and then refused to copy a file onto itself.
/HISTORY.md
/MIRROR.md
